        {
          "text": " Na sasa nimetia nchi hizi zote katika mkono wa Nebukadneza, mfalme wa Babeli, mtumishi wangu; na wanyama pori pia nimempa wamtumikie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.6"
            ]
